# Database / Backend

- MySQL is the project database.
- Use the project's selected ORM/data layer consistently.
- Before adding a model/table/field, confirm it is required.
- Avoid duplicate data and unnecessary relations.
- Keep database access server-side.
- Validate input before database writes.
- Handle database errors safely.
- Do not expose internal database errors to end users.
- Do not invent migrations or destructive schema changes without need.
- Preserve existing production-safe data unless a destructive change is explicitly approved.
